@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Seat assignment and enforcement (Module 9): LabsController POST /api/labs/{labId}/workstations
' (Admin,SuperAdmin; 409 duplicate machine number, 400 invalid IP, audit WORKSTATION_CREATED),
' ExamsController PUT /api/exams/{examId}/assignments/{userId}/workstation (Teacher,Admin,SuperAdmin; EligibilityPage;
' 409 seat taken, audit WORKSTATION_ASSIGNED), student/start -> CheckSeatOnStartAsync (SeatGuard.RefusesClient: 403
' DESKTOP_CLIENT_REQUIRED when Exams:RequireDesktopClientForStart, default true; SeatGuard.Check by SeatMatch =
' MachineName | Ip | Either; ReportMismatchAsync audits SEAT_MISMATCH and pushes ViolationEvent),
' MonitoringController.Heartbeat (re-check; a SeatMismatch event only if none with the same payload within
' SeatMismatchDedupWindow = 5 min, and only while the session is InProgress).
' Simplified labels: endpoints, status codes and audit event names are in the chapter text.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}

|Staff (Web Panel)|
start
:Admin adds a
workstation (number,
host name, IP);
|Server|
if (Number unique,\nIP valid?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes])
  :Save, audit;
endif
|Staff (Web Panel)|
:Teacher or admin
assigns a seat
to a student;
|Server|
if (Seat free in\nthis exam?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes])
  :Save seat,
  audit;
endif
|Desktop App (Student)|
:Start the
exam;
|Server|
if (Desktop\nclient?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Compare PC name
or IP with the seat;
if (Seat enforced\nand wrong PC?) then ([yes])
  :Refuse, audit,
  alert monitor;
  stop
else ([no])
  :Create the
  session;
endif
repeat
  |Desktop App (Student)|
  :Heartbeat
  (10 s);
  |Server|
  if (New seat\nmismatch?) then ([yes])
    :Record, audit,
    alert monitor;
  else ([no])
  endif
repeat while (In\nprogress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
stop
@enduml
